# Project

Unofficial GTA VI / Vice City **cinematic fan site**. Not affiliated with Rockstar / Take-Two.

**Human source of truth:** `/PROJECT.md` — read it before generating or modifying code.

## Status

Content/tools Phases 1–6 shipped. Active track: **Cinematic Overhaul (C0–C8)** per `docs/CINEMATIC-ROADMAP.md`.

## Non-negotiables

- Recreate Only-in-Leonida **feel** (pacing, media scale, storytelling) — never copy Rockstar source/assets
- Server Components default; thin `page.tsx`; animation islands only
- Three.js accents only — never canvas-as-entire-site
- LCP = poster/image; gate video/WebGL/YouTube
- `RELEASE_DATE_ISO` in `src/constants/release.ts` only
- Visible fan disclaimer

## Stack

Next.js 15 · React 19 · TypeScript · Tailwind v4 · GSAP · Lenis · R3F · Framer Motion · MDX
